# Backend API - Walkthrough

Production-ready REST API for SVI K-12 School Website built with Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and Cloudinary.

## ✅ What Was Built

### Project Structure
```
backend/
├── config/          # DB & Cloudinary config
├── controllers/     # 10 controller files
├── middleware/      # Auth, RBAC, Upload, Error handling
├── models/          # 9 MongoDB schemas
├── routes/          # 10 route files
├── scripts/         # Database seeder
├── utils/           # Token & Cloudinary helpers
├── server.js        # Express app entry point
└── .env.example     # Environment template
```

---

### MongoDB Models

| Model | Key Fields |
|-------|------------|
| User | name, email, password (hashed), role (Admin/Editor) |
| Blog | title, slug, content, image, video, youtubeUrl, status |
| Notice | title, content, type, attachment, active |
| Program | name, level (KG-NEB), stream (Science/Management), subjects |
| Gallery | title, type, category, cloudinaryId, url |
| Teacher | name, position, department, email, image |
| Inquiry | studentName, parentName, grade, status |
| Message | name, email, subject, message, read |
| Hero | video (Cloudinary), overlayTitle, ctaText |

---

### API Endpoints

| Group | Public | Admin/Editor |
|-------|--------|--------------|
| Auth | `POST /login` | `POST /register`, `GET /users` |
| Blogs | `GET /`, `GET /:slug` | `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` |
| Notices | `GET /`, `GET /:id` | `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` |
| Programs | `GET /`, `GET /:id` | `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` |
| Gallery | `GET /`, `GET /:id` | `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` |
| Teachers | `GET /`, `GET /:id` | `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` |
| Inquiries | `POST /` | `GET /`, `PATCH /:id`, `DELETE` |
| Messages | `POST /` | `GET /`, `PATCH /:id`, `DELETE` |
| Hero | `GET /` | `PUT /` |
| Dashboard | - | `GET /stats` |

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
cd d:\svi\backend

# 1. Update .env with your credentials
# MongoDB URI, JWT secret, Cloudinary keys

# 2. Seed database (creates admin user + sample data)
npm run seed

# 3. Start dev server
npm run dev
```

**Default Admin Login:**
- Email: `admin@svischool.edu.np`
- Password: `Admin@123`

---

## 🔧 Environment Setup

Update [.env](file:///d:/svi/backend/.env) with:

```env
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/svi_school
JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your-cloud-name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your-api-key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your-api-secret
```

---

## ✅ Verification

```
Server running on port 5000
MongoDB Connected: localhost
```

The API is ready to connect with the frontend at `http://localhost:5000/api`.

---

## 🔗 Frontend Integration

Update the frontend [.env](file:///d:/svi/.env) to connect:

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
```

All API services in [src/api/index.js](file:///d:/svi/src/api/index.js) are already configured for these endpoints.
